# Home and End, in both of the spellings a terminal sends them in: `ESC [ H`
# and `ESC [ 1 ~` are the same key on different terminals, and an editor
# that knew only one would be wrong on half the machines it runs on.
name ends.pas
size 6 20
push the quick brown
draw
esc F
draw
esc H
draw
esc 4~
draw
esc 1~
draw
